<title>ROMANIA: Romania Banca Comerciala net profit rises in 1996.</title>
<headline>Romania Banca Comerciala net profit rises in 1996.</headline>
<dateline>BUCHAREST 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Full-year to December 31</p>
<p>				(billions of leu unless stated)</p>
<p>					  1996	     1995</p>
<p> gross profit			613.67	   686.97</p>
<p> net profit			  557.22	   484.32</p>
<p> total assets		    8,757.06	 4,735.24</p>
<p> share capital		     216.74	   109.09</p>
<p> dividend			    172.97	   144.87</p>
<p>NOTE:  Banca Comerciala Romana SA state-owned bank handles the bulk of credits for the country's industrial sector. Data reported are in nominal terms and according to Romania's accounting standards.</p>
<p>($=7,053 lei)</p>
<p>-- Bucharest Newsroom 40-1 3120264</p>
